365 0 obj
  << /ActualText (First let me explain what a trip is\056 Assume you are going from your house to office on a train \055 thats one trip\056 \050your return journey is another trip\051\056 This trip has 3 legs\056 First leg\054 from your house to station\054 then your train journey and third is from station to office\056 You can walk\054 get an auto\054 ride a bike \055 That doesn\031t matter\056\nWe are looking at over 15 million trips that the city of Mumbai makes each day\056 I am quoting this from a study that )
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 368 0 R
     /Pg 351 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

