367 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( did in 2014 called the Comprehensive Mobility Plan\056 About 70\045\053 commutes by the train\056 Then you have the BEST\054 followed by IPTs \055 taxis\054 auto rickshaws and now the Ubers and Olas\054 followed by motorcycle\054 followed by car\056 All of this is just the motorised trips\056 The study estimated that about 51\045 of all trips in Mumbai happen on foot\056 Personal automobiles are 5\0557\045 of all trips that happen in Mumbai\056 So largely this is how Mumbai travels\056)
